{"id": 28, "name": "Alpha", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e7ace719171987280795da2c885daf03.png", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Charge", "Damage"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["60", "40", "70", "10"], "lanes": ["Jungle", "Exp Lane"], "story": "A pure cyborg made by Laboratory 1718.", "skills": [{"name": "Beta, Advance!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6b3c9aef499eeb19ec98dfbac22bb33c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "When Alpha uses a skill, Beta will be summoned to attack. Enemies that are hit by Beta 2 time(s) will be <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Locked On</span>.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Locked On</span>: After Alpha deals damage to the target, Beta will fire a laser at them, dealing 80<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">(+8*Hero Level)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> and briefly applying a powerful slow effect.\nThis skill only deals 75% damage to Creeps."}, {"name": "Rotary Impact", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8feb5b13b48b71de18f1490269cb1623.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 4   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Alpha unleashes an energy wave in the target direction, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+90% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in its path and slowing them by 40% for 1s.\n\nBeta then strafes enemies along the same path, dealing 60<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Force Swing", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_601fedfb2ef64598acdf449ad2b29216.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6   Mana Cost: 45", "desc": "After a short delay, Alpha swings his blade in the target direction, dealing 180<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in a fan-shaped area and restoring 40<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Extra Physical Attack)</span> HP for each enemy hit.\n\nBeta then strafes enemies in the same area, dealing 60<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Spear of Alpha", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_7f192b19efc5c9dcbd6e5c11e187e86d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Beta dives to the target location, dealing 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+20% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies hit and stunning them for 1s. Alpha then leaps towards the same location, knocking enemies in his path airborne and carrying them to the landing location. Alpha then slams down, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> and slowing the enemies by 40% for 1.5s.\n\nBeta then attacks the same area 5 times, dealing 15<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Extra Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#ffe63c\">True Damage</span> each time."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Ice Hunter's Tough Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_a8d1d86a8d37e872f66334a4c373621c.png"}, {"name": "Hunter Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/i